  "summary": "金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜ こんにちは！日向坂46 金村美玖です🖼 本日のブログは今までのオフショットを 令和になる前にざーっと振り返りながら見ていきたいなと思います。 それでは！どうぞ！ レッスン風景。 このちゃんにパーカー...",
  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">🔔</span><span class=\"s3\">*</span><span class=\"s1\">゜</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">こんにちは！日向坂</span><span class=\"s3\">46&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s1\">金村美玖です</span><span class=\"s2\">🖼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本日のブログは今までのオフショットを</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">令和になる前にざーっと振り返りながら見ていきたいなと思います。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！どうぞ！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">レッスン風景。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8457.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">このちゃんにパーカー結ばれてます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8458.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">ﾍ(</span><span class=\"s3\">°</span><span class=\"s1\">∀</span><span class=\"s3\">°</span><span class=\"s1\">ﾍ)バァ</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">駅伝練習の時</span><span class=\"s2\">🎽</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8440.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">意外と走るの楽しかったなあ。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8425.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">でも翌日足がパンパンでした</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">笑</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">横アリ</span><span class=\"s3\">3days</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8450.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">外ハネに</span><span class=\"s3\">no war</span><span class=\"s1\">は中々珍しい。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この衣装は思い出深いです。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8451.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">お、ライブ終わったよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">✌</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8452.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">にぶちゃん何処か行ってしまったけど、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんな増えたよ〜！！おつかれ〜！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8453.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">キュン</span><span class=\"s2\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">このステージのセット、全てが空色で大好きです。可愛かったな</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">その他にも色々ありますが、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_8.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8433.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">今回はこの辺で。以前ブログやメッセージで送っていたものがあったらごめんなさい</span><span class=\"s2\">🙇‍♀️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">多分似ていてもちょっと違うはず！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また溜まったらこんな感じで書きますね。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">see you later </span><span class=\"s4\">✩</span><span class=\"s3\">*.</span><span class=\"s1\">ﾟ</span><span class=\"s3\">#148</span></span></p></div>\n                    ",
  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby>ブログ<ruby>更新<rt>こうしん</rt></ruby>のお<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>ですよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">🔔</span><span class=\"s3\">*</span><span class=\"s1\">゜</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">こんにちは！<ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">46&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby><ruby>美玖<rt>みく</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s2\">🖼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>本日<rt>ほんじつ</rt></ruby>のブログは<ruby>今<rt>いま</rt></ruby>までのオフショットを</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>令<rt>りょう</rt></ruby><ruby>和<rt>わ</rt></ruby>になる<ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>にざーっと<ruby>振り返<rt>ふりかえ</rt></ruby>りながら<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>ていきたいなと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！どうぞ！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">レッスン<ruby>風景<rt>ふうけい</rt></ruby>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8457.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">このちゃんにパーカー<ruby>結<rt>むす</rt></ruby>ばれてます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8458.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">ﾍ(</span><span class=\"s3\">°</span><span class=\"s1\">∀</span><span class=\"s3\">°</span><span class=\"s1\">ﾍ)バァ</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>駅伝<rt>えきでん</rt></ruby><ruby>練習<rt>れんしゅう</rt></ruby>の<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s2\">🎽</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8440.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>意外<rt>いがい</rt></ruby>と<ruby>走<rt>はし</rt></ruby>るの<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しかったなあ。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8425.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">でも<ruby>翌日<rt>よくじつ</rt></ruby><ruby>足<rt>あし</rt></ruby>がパンパンでした</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>横<rt>よこ</rt></ruby>アリ</span><span class=\"s3\">3days</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8450.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>外<rt>そと</rt></ruby>ハネに</span><span class=\"s3\">no war</span><span class=\"s1\">は<ruby>中<rt>なか</rt></ruby>々<ruby>珍<rt>めずら</rt></ruby>しい。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この<ruby>衣装<rt>いしょう</rt></ruby>は<ruby>思い出深<rt>おもいでぶか</rt></ruby>いです。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8451.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">お、ライブ<ruby>終<rt>お</rt></ruby>わったよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">✌</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8452.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">にぶちゃん<ruby>何処<rt>どこ</rt></ruby>か<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>ってしまったけど、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんな<ruby>増<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>えたよ〜！！おつかれ〜！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8453.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">キュン</span><span class=\"s2\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">このステージのセット、<ruby>全<rt>すべ</rt></ruby>てが<ruby>空色<rt>そらいろ</rt></ruby>で<ruby>大好<rt>だいす</rt></ruby>きです。<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>かったな</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">その<ruby>他<rt>た</rt></ruby>にも<ruby>色々<rt>いろいろ</rt></ruby>ありますが、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-04-26/28798_8.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8433.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>はこの<ruby>辺<rt>あたり</rt></ruby>で。<ruby>以前<rt>いぜん</rt></ruby>ブログやメッセージで<ruby>送<rt>おく</rt></ruby>っていたものがあったらごめんなさい</span><span class=\"s2\">🙇‍♀️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>多分<rt>たぶん</rt></ruby><ruby>似<rt>に</rt></ruby>ていてもちょっと<ruby>違<rt>ちが</rt></ruby>うはず！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また<ruby>溜<rt>た</rt></ruby>まったらこんな<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じで<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>きますね。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">see you later </span><span class=\"s4\">✩</span><span class=\"s3\">*.</span><span class=\"s1\">ﾟ</span><span class=\"s3\">#148</span></span></p></div>\n                    ",
